  "description": "Platform-agnostic process execution context for business logic that must run identically in a Dataverse plug-in, an Azure Function, or a test harness.\n\nSource distribution. The .cs files are compiled into the consuming assembly, for\nDataverse custom workflow activities and on-premises deployments, which cannot\nuse plug-in packages. For every other consumer, reference JMCL.Core.ProcessModel instead.\n\nIMPORTANT: NuGet does not flow contentFiles transitively. Reference ALL of these\npackages directly, not just this one:\n  JMCL.Core.ProcessModel.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.IocContainer.Sources",
